{
    "description": "restore_snapshot rejects a binary snapshot holding a live node that no parent's child slots name, with INCONSISTENT_SNAPSHOT. Cross-language lock for the HEU-750 slice 2 slot agreement check. Before it, check_every_live_node_has_a_slot proved each live node was a slot key and nothing proved it was a slot value, so this payload was accepted and get_branch then disagreed with get_children about the same tree. The payload spells out the Arena and slot shapes by hand, so a new required field on Arena, Node or BinaryTree turns this into a deserialization failure rather than the rejection it tests.",
